The '''North Reaches''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Purpose ==
The '''North Reaches''' are a large plateau near {{Zone|Tangleburg}} connected by bridges with [[Fig Log|Fig Tree]]s to chop. Additionally, [[Lushlilac|Lushlilac Bushes]] can be picked for {{Item|Lushlilac}}.

